    Duel.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nIf this card was Normal Summoned this turn and
    you have a face-up Level 5 or lower Pendulum Monster Card in your Extra Deck:
    You can Tribute this card; choose 1 face-up Level 5 or lower Pendulum Monster
    Card in your Extra Deck, and Special Summon 2 monsters from your Deck with the
    same name as that card, but they have their effects negated, also they are destroyed
    during the End Phase."
